    issue('registered-version-and-boundary',[1,26],'Registered source is arXiv2206.08756v3 marked15Jan2024,65pages, submitted-to-AoS preprint. Main text ends with acknowledgements on page26 before REFERENCES y328.151; clip322. All supplementary bodies, starting32, are excluded. No assumption of identity with the published version is made.')
    issue('rgn-time-zero-factor',[11,15],'Theorem2 prints2^(-2^t) for all t≥0, even without noise. At t=0 it implies e0≤e0/2 unless e0=0. The corresponding Corollary1 RGN factor has the same issue. Preserve the original; do not repair the exponent or shift the time range.')
