    data=dict(paper_id=PID,unranked_auxiliary_passages=aux,statement_local_bindings=bindings,source_claim_references=refs,source_issues=issues,ambient_prerequisites=['Finite real arrays and matrices, componentwise rank inequalities, Frobenius inner product/norm and matrix operator norm, singular values and QR, orthonormal frames and orthogonal complements as archived in A1/A4.','Mode products, contraction and matricization retain the available original definitions; unresolved detailed indexing is explicitly flagged rather than filled from excluded supplements.','Finite-dimensional Gaussian laws, iid/conditional sampling, expectations, probabilities, variances, polynomial total degree, Kronecker/outer products, empirical sample indexing and minimax quantifiers; no mathlib availability assertion.'],validation_limits='A source census preserves statements and dependencies. It does not prove the claims, repair the source, inspect excluded supplements, or perform mathlib search.')
